<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Remove the many veils that are now cov’ring me,</l><l>My heart I turn, O Lord—Spirit come and set me free!</l><l>The bondages and limits break,</l><l>That deeper mingling Thou would’st make;</l><l>Oh, may Thy life grow more today</l><l>Until Thy life fills all my ways.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>When to Thy word I come, help me to contact Thee,</l><l>Be present, dear and fresh—let Thy speaking water me;</l><l>Oh, may my spirit, Spirit strike,</l><l>Thy Holy Word, a flame, ignite!</l><l>Thy present word to me make clear;</l><l>Thy secret things, Lord, I would hear.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
